@startuml 07-seq-later-access
title Later access and token refresh (step 17)
autonumber
participant "TPP back end" as TPP
participant "OIDC provider" as OIDC
participant "Bank XS2A API" as XS2A
participant "Bank consent mgmt" as CM

TPP -> XS2A : GET /v1/accounts (expired access token)
XS2A --> TPP : 401 TOKEN_EXPIRED
TPP -> OIDC : POST /token (mTLS) grant_type=refresh_token
OIDC -> CM : consent still valid?
CM --> OIDC : valid
OIDC --> TPP : new access_token (+ rotated refresh_token)
TPP -> XS2A : GET /v1/accounts (new token, no PSU-IP-Address)
XS2A -> CM : usage today per account < frequencyPerDay?
alt within frequency
  XS2A --> TPP : 200 accounts
else exceeded
  XS2A --> TPP : 429 ACCESS_EXCEEDED
end
@enduml
